                                "text": "a liberatory conflict"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e27f65bb-192b-4985-825e-9123a63f97e1",
                                "sense_id": "ea1ef50c-b97d-3628-b4c4-d18c453dc361",
                                "text": "One of the difficulties facing efforts to constitute a radicalized articulation of ecology remains that nature has been more firmly affixed to hegemonic discourses, e.g. consumerism or \"resourceism\" than to liberatory discourses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ee46098-5a7b-48c2-952f-daf6f16b831f",
                                "sense_id": "ea1ef50c-b97d-3628-b4c4-d18c453dc361",
                                "text": "In the case of Rothbard, for example, crusader's faith in the efficiency and liberatory potential of the invisible hand is resolutely resistant to the piled-up evidence that it's a catastrophe for the many."
                            }
                        ]
